{"4264680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rogue Assault", "steam_appid": 4264680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/b8146966b0db8924ff9ccad0529b1a6e.poster.avif?t=1780482298\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/b8146966b0db8924ff9ccad0529b1a6e.webm?t=1780482298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/b8146966b0db8924ff9ccad0529b1a6e.mp4?t=1780482298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/b85a6a2eeb7228c65bac5741fa452d69.avif?t=1780482298\" width=690 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A realistic real-time strategy military game with direct control over your army vehicles, <strong>no build times</strong>, and stunning 3D graphics set in a post-apocalyptic world where resources are scarce and Europe has turned into a war zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to build up your power or join forces with a team and form a formidable alliance to defend your home territory in PVP combat against other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch strategic strikes against your enemy with an array of war machines, tanks, and modern warfare infantry. Defend your base, customize your units and seize your opponents’ resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/be1bbe76bdd662262a6e0b6bb8d1b9eb.poster.avif?t=1780482298\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/be1bbe76bdd662262a6e0b6bb8d1b9eb.webm?t=1780482298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/be1bbe76bdd662262a6e0b6bb8d1b9eb.mp4?t=1780482298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/446ef8fc8d8ae5e395d5704c509fee05.avif?t=1780482298\" width=690 height=72 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Instant Construction for Military Facilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No build times means no waiting around - place buildings instantly and get straight into the action. Gather resources, expand your base, and deploy defenses immediately, so you can react fast, adapt your strategy, and keep the pressure on your opponents and your defenses impenetrable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/2f13384b17b167b30976577f03effdc2.poster.avif?t=1780482298\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/2f13384b17b167b30976577f03effdc2.webm?t=1780482298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/2f13384b17b167b30976577f03effdc2.mp4?t=1780482298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full Control Over 120+ Units on the Battlefield</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command over 120+ unique units and take direct, individual control of each one in real time as the battle unfolds. Discover new technologies, research upgrades, and train troops to unlock advanced units - then deploy them strategically to outmaneuver and destroy your opponent.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/673816489e25472c594a8de5b719df78.poster.avif?t=1780482298\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/673816489e25472c594a8de5b719df78.webm?t=1780482298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/673816489e25472c594a8de5b719df78.mp4?t=1780482298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PvE and PvP Real-time Strategy Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight other players in PvP battles for glory, territory, and total dominance as you climb the ranks and test your strategy against real opponents. Or dive into PvE and progress through a campaign that reveals more of this war-torn world, sharpening your skills with every mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/68e4107bd1de20c75e859261406aaad6.poster.avif?t=1780482298\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/68e4107bd1de20c75e859261406aaad6.webm?t=1780482298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/68e4107bd1de20c75e859261406aaad6.mp4?t=1780482298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fully Customizable and Upgradeable Base</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build a commander base that’s fully yours to design—reorder and organize every part of it for maximum efficiency and tactical defense placement. Upgrade structures, strengthen fortifications, and customize your layout to match your playstyle, creating a base that adapts as the war escalates.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/3dad832ea212d8cdeccecf05dfaa9971.poster.avif?t=1780482298\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/3dad832ea212d8cdeccecf05dfaa9971.webm?t=1780482298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/3dad832ea212d8cdeccecf05dfaa9971.mp4?t=1780482298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Regular Events, Updates and New Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay engaged with regular events and frequent updates that keep the battlefield evolving. New units, features, and balance improvements arrive over time, giving you fresh strategies to master, new content to unlock, and more reasons to return and push your commander further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/42561c7434943a1b00d8524e81b63462.poster.avif?t=1780482298\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/42561c7434943a1b00d8524e81b63462.webm?t=1780482298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/42561c7434943a1b00d8524e81b63462.mp4?t=1780482298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/b8146966b0db8924ff9ccad0529b1a6e.poster.avif?t=1780482298\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/b8146966b0db8924ff9ccad0529b1a6e.webm?t=1780482298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/b8146966b0db8924ff9ccad0529b1a6e.mp4?t=1780482298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4264680/extras/b85a6a2eeb7228c65bac5741fa452d69.avif?t=1780482298\" width=690 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A realistic real-time strategy military game with direct control over your army vehicles, <strong>no build times</strong>, and stunning 3D graphics set in a post-apocalyptic world where resources are scarce and Europe has turned into a war zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to build up your power or join forces with a team and form a formidable alliance to defend your home territory in PVP combat against other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch strategic strikes against your enemy with an array of war machines, tanks, and modern warfare infantry. Defend your base, customize your units and seize your opponents’ resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\